// Host-seam ratchet: code under lib/cyrus may not gain NEW imports of Nxeon internals (anything outside lib/cyrus).
// Existing coupling is recorded in test/fixtures/cyrus-host-seam-baseline.json and can only SHRINK: a new import fails
